adios2
------------------------------------------
ADIOS2 is a unified framework for I/O and in situ data processing of
large-scale scientific data, with C, C++ and Fortran bindings.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libadios2_2.12-2.12.1-1bl2
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libhdf5_320-2.2.0-1
  libpng16-1.6.59-1
  libsodium26-1.0.20-1
  libsqlite3_0-3.49.1-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libzfp1-1.0.1-1bl3
  libzmq5-4.3.5-1
  libzstd1-1.5.7-1
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python312-3.12.12-1
  python312-adios2-2.12.1-1bl2
  python312-numpy-2.5.4-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

