Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ornladios/ADIOS2

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ornladios/ADIOS2/archive/refs/tags/v2.12.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack adios2-2.12.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./adios2-2.12.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/adios2-2.12.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/adios2-2.12.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/adios2-h5vol-2.12.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libadios2_2.12-2.12.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libadios2-devel-2.12.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-adios2-2.12.1-X.tar.xz

